# ==================== GMAIL REMOTE ====================
IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User zhafacai@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass google/guixapp"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

# ==================== LOCAL MAILDIR ====================
MaildirStore gmail-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/Documents/Mail/
Inbox ~/Documents/Mail/Inbox

# ==================== CHANNEL SYNC ====================
Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "[Gmail]/Drafts" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail"
Create Near
SyncState *
